{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：07:33 2026-10-27 HKT<br/>發佈時間：07:33 2026-10-27 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：07:33 2026-10-27 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/68f698bba02bfe42216ec4854fef48dd/2026-10/2026-10-26_23_11_58.png\"/><p>東北季候風正影響廣東沿岸。同時，一道雲雨帶正覆蓋該區。本港今早部分地區錄得約10毫米雨量。</p><img alt=\"本港地區今日早晚部分時間多雲及有幾陣雨。黎志偉攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/eb39eff45a6f4e1165623ad312573a2d/2026-10/23_4.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d4c3f247c7d9f36a8a25a1ec244f366d/2026-10/2026-10-26_23_11_03.png\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/89ad3412edbd26873a9a3bd189cb08e1/2026-10/2026-10-26_23_11_12.png\"/><img alt=\"本港地區今日早晚部分時間多雲及有幾陣雨。黎志偉攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/81b584237bdf5d8afb3797c6be654c1f/2026-10/24_3.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"本港地區今日早晚部分時間多雲及有幾陣雨。黎志偉攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/27b95029750ffe5551f3bbf0aedf60cc/2026-10/22_7.jpeg\"/><p>本港地區今日早晚部分時間多雲及有幾陣雨。日間大致天晴，最高氣溫約30度。吹和緩至清勁東至東北風，晚上離岸間中吹強風。</p><p>展望未來數日天色大致良好。明日至星期四初時風勢較大。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T23:40:54.679578+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":214,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T23:33:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T01:18:31.533637+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T23:38:44.540425+00:00","content_hash":"618a46610a234809307ba3dc1917167735f31b181b6ae9ca49f256822483a3c8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}